10 workflows Command
********************

‘rl workflows’ scaffolds GitHub Actions workflow files.  At least one of
‘--check’ or ‘--package’ must be given.

10.1 Options
============

‘--check’
     Generate a workflow that runs ‘rl check’ on push/PR.

‘--package’
     Generate a workflow that packages and releases a binary.

10.2 Examples
=============

     $ rl workflows --check
     $ rl workflows --package
     $ rl workflows --check --package


