13 Examples
***********

13.1 Running a Script
=====================

     $ rl run hello.rl
     Hello, world!

13.2 Running with Arguments
===========================

     $ rl run script.rl -- --verbose input.txt

13.3 Inline Code
================

     $ rl run -c 'println("hello")'
     hello

13.4 Type Checking
==================

     $ rl check script.rl

13.5 Running Tests
==================

     $ rl test tests.rl

13.6 Formatting
===============

     $ rl format script.rl

13.7 Compiling to Bytecode
==========================

     $ rlc compile script.rl -o output.rlc

13.8 Printing Tokens
====================

     $ rl print script.rl --tokens

13.9 Transpiling to C
=====================

     $ rlt script.rl --runtime --compile

13.10 Packaging a Binary
========================

     $ rl package script.rl -o myapp

13.11 Starting the REPL
=======================

     $ rlrepl


